Agents are frontmatter Markdown files: agents/<name>.md.

A valid agent requires name, description, and a system prompt body:

---
name: reviewer
description: Review a change for correctness.
---

Review the assigned change and report concrete findings.

OMP also accepts optional fields such as model, tools, spawns, thinking-level,
structured, and autoloadSkills. Project agents are discovered from
~/.omp/agent/agents (linked to this directory) and .omp/agents in the working
project.

This README intentionally has no .md extension so it is not parsed as an agent.
OMP only loads *.md files from this directory.
